{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108520","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108520","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1510852001:0":{"text":"Did you make this yourself?","source_cn":"是你亲手做的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD504A4A641EE10E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510852002:0":{"text":"Yeah. I heard it's a tradition among the Wildborn—men carve statues of the women they love, and give it to them during the courtship festival.","source_cn":"嗯。我听说在雅库伯尔的习俗里，男人会按照心爱女人的模样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB7162208EA772F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510852003:1":{"text":"If the woman accepts it, it means she accepts his love.","source_cn":"如果女方愿意收下石雕，就代表接受这段感情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17788D0FF848D036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510852004:1":{"text":"I'm not a Wildborn, and this gift is a bit late but I wanted you to have what others do. No regrets.","source_cn":"我不是雅库伯尔人，这份礼物也有点迟，但我不希望给你留下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4570086E6C0F1ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510852005:0":{"text":"... Perseus.","source_cn":"……珀尔修斯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B2EFDF19FC4C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510852006:0":{"text":"What's wrong? You don't want to accept it?","source_cn":"怎么了，你不愿意收下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9E6E95A5474637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510852007:0":{"text":"No... I do. I'll accept it.\nLet's call it... a <style=\"highlight\">farewell gift</style>.","source_cn":"不，我愿意收下。\\n就当做是你给我的<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AB5008AC2509E05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510852008:0":{"text":"Farewell? Wait, I don't understand.","source_cn":"送别……？等等，我没听懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A05501E329A8953","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510852009:0":{"text":"We can't meet again. I've been chosen to offer my life to the Hunting Goddess.","source_cn":"我们不能再见面了，因为我要向狩猎神献上自己的生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x249F786D0E4612F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510852010:0":{"text":"Chosen? You mean—you're going to be sacrificed?!","source_cn":"献、献上生命？雅库伯尔选择了你作为祭品？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA366B56AEF9F2461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510852011:0":{"text":"Yes. I'm honored.","source_cn":"是啊，我非常荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4540D39B2F08AD73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510852012:0":{"text":"To be offered to the <style=\"highlight\">Hunting Goddess Azora</style> is the greatest blessing of a Wildborn. My soul will find peace at her side.","source_cn":"能被献给<style=highlight>狩猎神奥法迦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B028B3C19E9DB86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510852013:0":{"text":"But... you're her divine emissary! You were chosen to deliver her will to her followers. Why would they want you dead?","source_cn":"可你……你不是她的神使吗？你的任务是替神明向信徒传达神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0D2E02EE55E6B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510852014:0":{"text":"It was the goddess herself who chose me. She must <style=\"highlight\">seal the temple, withdraw, and gather greater strength</style>.","source_cn":"是狩猎神选中了我，因为她要<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE667331B89336A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510852015:0":{"text":"At such a pivotal moment, my role as her messenger is to give my life in the prayer ritual—only then can my soul enter the temple and <style=\"highlight\">serve her directly</style>.","source_cn":"这种重要的时刻，作为神使我必须在祝祷祭礼上舍弃生命。如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23FF1A4DFBA20620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510852016:0":{"text":"This is... insane. You're really ready to die, just to serve the Hunting Goddess?","source_cn":"这算什么……为了侍奉狩猎神，要你付出生命你也愿意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CD18E06F54DEDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510852017:0":{"text":"Gladly. It's an honor beyond words.","source_cn":"当然，这是殊荣，是其他人求都求不到的恩典。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFBDC53A72893549","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510852018:0":{"text":"Perseus, you know how noble the Hunting Goddess is. You should be happy for me.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你知道狩猎神是如此尊贵，你该为我高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DE03EC1F2CAC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510852019:0":{"text":"Happy for you... what about me? Where do I fit in all of this?","source_cn":"为你高兴……那我呢？我算什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90B3CD6A1D1487C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510852020:0":{"text":"... Why would you say that? Do you really think I would abandon my faith for love?","source_cn":"……你为什么会说出这种话？难道你以为我会为了爱情，放弃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x657FFCEE663E7CA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510852021:0":{"text":"I never asked that! I... I'd never dare...","source_cn":"我没这么想过！我根本不敢这么想！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE2996AEE3CDB98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510852022:0":{"text":"Then live well. And wait for me—wait for me to find you again.","source_cn":"你，好好生活下去，等我再次找到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2303C41366184A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510852023:0":{"text":"... Find me?","source_cn":"……等你找到我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B34156DFBF6462","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510852024:0":{"text":"Yes. <style=\"highlight\">In the next life</style>, wait for me.","source_cn":"是啊，<style=highlight>下一世</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36E5ADA574D68ACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510852025:0":{"text":"The goddess will send me back to you. I'm her messenger—she knows our hearts, and she's granted me this one wish.","source_cn":"狩猎神会将我再次送到你身边。我是她的神使，她谅解我和你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB1082B49AB08981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510852026:0":{"text":"No... please, tell me this is a joke. Tell me you're not serious.","source_cn":"告诉我，你不是认真的，你只是在开玩笑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x781A692975CF372E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510852027:0":{"text":"Don't cry. This is just a goodbye for now. One day, we'll meet again.","source_cn":"不要悲伤。我们只是暂时分别，总有一天会重逢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x948E28E2C298884D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510852028:0":{"text":"And when that day comes... you have to recognize me.","source_cn":"到时候，你要认出我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x068AE8BBECB28C6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510852029:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8383C81AFA3C5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510852030:0":{"text":"Promise me, Perseus. You'll know me when you see me... won't you?","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，我要你保证。你会认出我的，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE683CC6CFD14E2EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510852031:0":{"text":"I... I will.","source_cn":"对……我当然会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x896DE2DB815AF2FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1510852032:0":{"text":"Do you promise?","source_cn":"你保证？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEFFFEB2C3D971C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510852033:0":{"text":"I promise...","source_cn":"我保证……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90CEA6CC23F25507","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:露":{"text":"Gorgonna","source":"露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"Perseus","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":34,"localized_text_count":33,"speaker_count":2}}